<section class="hero-panel" aria-labelledby="home-heading">
  <div class="container-fluid page-container">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <span class="hero-eyebrow">Citizen portal</span>
      <h1 id="home-heading">Apply, Renew and Manage Your Trinidad and Tobago Passport</h1>
      <p>Explore the design preview for a proposed passport service. Accounts, applications, identity checks and payments are not connected.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-gold" href="/citizen/apply/first-time">Apply Now</a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline-light" href="/account/sign-in">Sign In</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="page-section" aria-labelledby="services-heading">
  <div class="container-fluid page-container">
    <div class="row g-4">
      <div class="col-lg-8">
        <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="services-heading">Passport Services</h2></div>
        <div class="row g-3">
          <div class="col-md-4">
            <article class="service-card">
              <span class="service-mark" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
              <h3>First-Time Application</h3>
              <p>View the proposed first-time application flow for citizens aged 16 and over.</p>
              <a class="btn btn-primary-government" href="/citizen/apply/first-time">View preview</a>
            </article>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-4">
            <article class="service-card">
              <span class="service-mark" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
              <h3>Passport Renewal</h3>
              <p>Renewal is a planned service and is not included in this design preview.</p>
              <span class="planned-label">Planned · Not available</span>
            </article>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-4">
            <article class="service-card">
              <span class="service-mark" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
              <h3>Track an Application</h3>
              <p>See the proposed tracking layout. No application lookup is connected.</p>
              <a class="btn btn-outline-crimson" href="/citizen/track">View tracking preview</a>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-4" id="help">
        <div class="section-heading"><h2>Eligibility &amp; Help</h2></div>
        <div class="help-list">
          <a class="help-link" href="/citizen/apply/first-time#eligibility">
            <div><strong>Who can apply?</strong><span>See the proposed first-time age scope.</span></div><span aria-hidden="true">›</span>
          </a>
          <a class="help-link" href="/citizen/apply/first-time#application-heading">
            <div><strong>Required documents</strong><span>Official document instructions are not connected.</span></div><span aria-hidden="true">›</span>
          </a>
          <a class="help-link" href="/#help">
            <div><strong>Support</strong><span>Account support content is a placeholder.</span></div><span aria-hidden="true">›</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="info-panel mt-4">
      <p class="section-kicker">Proposed service design</p>
      <h2>A clear path, with each decision kept separate</h2>
      <p class="mb-0">Account access, identity proofing, citizenship eligibility, application decisions, passport issuance and physical release are separate future controls. None is active in this preview.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
